    "Description":  "UH-60L/DAP tactile profile with seat-calibrated 1-rev, 2-rev, and blade-pass baseline presence for parked-hot and straight-and-level flight. It retains torque-first and collective-fallback power swell, airborne signed-G and lateral/control response, asymmetric per-harmonic smoothing, and adds validated low-level buffet onset plus a restrained raw maneuver-load blend.",
